WEBVTT

00:00:19.252 --> 00:00:22.449
Luchs! What did he say?!
What did Lord Faust say?!

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:24.722
It's over...

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:27.920
I haven't anything left to tell him
that he wants to hear...

00:00:28.395 --> 00:00:32.161
Luchs... This will be the
last time I ask for your report.

00:00:32.832 --> 00:00:34.857
Lord Faust...!
Surely, you don't mean!

00:00:35.969 --> 00:00:38.301
I mean, that you are
useless to me now.

00:00:40.774 --> 00:00:42.469
No!

00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:13.433
| came to this land to protect you.

00:01:13.807 --> 00:01:17.038
| was born to be with you.

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:20.380
The moment I awoke...

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:24.473
...prisms surrounded me.

00:01:24.651 --> 00:01:28.178
I'm here to love you now.

00:01:28.388 --> 00:01:31.756
I was born to hold you.

00:01:31.958 --> 00:01:34.928
Lies and truths...

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:39.055
...are all within ourselves.

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:43.801
The days I abandon my true feelings...

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:45.638
...won't get to me.

00:01:46.072 --> 00:01:49.167
Tenderness and caring...

00:01:49.676 --> 00:01:52.737
...can be ours once again!

00:01:53.113 --> 00:01:57.311
Day in, day out,
like a puppet on a string.

00:01:57.383 --> 00:02:01.149
Wandering in the void
between zero and infinity.

00:02:01.221 --> 00:02:04.589
The strength to sever
the tangled wires...

00:02:04.657 --> 00:02:09.322
...is still sleeping inside of you.

00:02:35.555 --> 00:02:37.956
The residents of north
district are under control.

00:02:38.458 --> 00:02:40.392
Food depot #3, locked down!

00:02:40.994 --> 00:02:44.123
Unit #4, continue pursuit
of rebel elements!

00:02:44.197 --> 00:02:45.926
Those insects.

00:02:45.999 --> 00:02:47.967
We have completed blocking
all main roads!

00:02:52.038 --> 00:02:57.204
Goddel, I don't care what you
do with them. They are yours.

00:02:57.810 --> 00:02:58.971
M'Lord.

00:02:59.245 --> 00:03:04.479
This can't be! Lord Faust,
must I take orders from another?!

00:03:04.551 --> 00:03:07.714
| beg you, Lord Faust!
Don't abandon me!

00:03:07.787 --> 00:03:09.255
Lord Faust"

00:03:14.694 --> 00:03:16.219
LORD FAUST?!

00:03:26.673 --> 00:03:27.834
Goddamn you!!

00:03:27.907 --> 00:03:30.604
This is your fault
YOU failed Lord Faust...

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:33.845
This is your fault
This is all your fault!!

00:03:35.048 --> 00:03:43.048
My First Kiss
Tasted Like Plasma

00:04:04.611 --> 00:04:06.340
This is fantastic!

00:04:06.412 --> 00:04:10.144
| didn't notice at all on the way in,
but when you stop to look at them...

00:04:10.216 --> 00:04:13.584
...these caverns are
really quite elegant!

00:04:14.454 --> 00:04:16.422
Don't you think so?

00:04:17.824 --> 00:04:19.417
Never mind that...

00:04:19.492 --> 00:04:21.984
Let's find somewhere
to rest, Otaru...!

00:04:22.061 --> 00:04:25.895
We haven't stopped walking
since we left Gartlant!

00:04:25.965 --> 00:04:27.455
Can't go on!

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:29.664
Too heavy...

00:04:30.903 --> 00:04:33.736
Otaru kissed her.
Otaru kissed her.

00:04:35.241 --> 00:04:36.936
Master Otaru...

00:04:38.344 --> 00:04:39.937
This sucks.

00:04:40.013 --> 00:04:42.880
What's with you guys?
You're acting weird.

00:04:44.317 --> 00:04:45.716
But you, you...

00:04:45.785 --> 00:04:47.685
You kissed her.

00:04:57.263 --> 00:04:58.492
But, listen!

00:04:58.564 --> 00:05:02.000
There was nothing else
| could have done back there!

00:05:02.068 --> 00:05:06.005
Yes, that is the reason why
we are all still alive, but...

00:05:06.072 --> 00:05:07.767
But that's a different
thing altogether!

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:10.468
If we knew you'd have to kiss
one of their saber dolls to do it...

00:05:11.511 --> 00:05:13.309
KISS ME, TOO!

00:05:13.379 --> 00:05:14.369
H..Hey, hey!

00:05:14.447 --> 00:05:16.006
C'mon, Otaru...!

00:05:16.082 --> 00:05:17.709
Master Otaru...!

00:05:19.852 --> 00:05:21.946
You idiots! What're
you blabbering about?!

00:05:22.322 --> 00:05:25.758
It's done, okay?!
Get over it already!

00:05:25.825 --> 00:05:27.554
Take it like a man!

00:05:33.232 --> 00:05:35.599
But I'm not a man...

00:05:39.605 --> 00:05:41.266
THAT'S RIGHT!

00:05:41.874 --> 00:05:43.808
In other words, the only one
qualified to deepen the bonds...

00:05:43.876 --> 00:05:46.243
...of living, breathing friendship
of man amongst fellow man...

00:05:46.579 --> 00:05:49.742
...is ME, the oh-so-manly
MITSURUGI HANAGATA!

00:05:50.316 --> 00:05:51.806
Thus said...

00:05:51.884 --> 00:05:55.718
...let us tighten our bonds, Otaru!

00:06:01.194 --> 00:06:02.855
That's HOT!

00:06:02.929 --> 00:06:04.419
Whassis?

00:06:05.531 --> 00:06:08.762
- DANGER: HIGH TEMPERATURE - It's a heated
underground spring containing sulfur crystals...

00:06:10.002 --> 00:06:12.266
In other words, a hot spring!

00:06:12.338 --> 00:06:13.567
Hot spring?

00:06:29.555 --> 00:06:30.852
Otaru!!

00:06:30.923 --> 00:06:32.914
Hey, hey! Come lookit this!

00:06:34.093 --> 00:06:36.790
"INN"

00:06:50.977 --> 00:06:53.275
"Guestbook"

00:06:57.450 --> 00:06:58.975
What is all this?

00:06:59.786 --> 00:07:01.777
Chuta River Leisure Land...Niika River Resort Hotel..Oyamada
Radon Hot Spring ...The Japoness Health Center...Amagami

00:07:02.555 --> 00:07:05.183
According to my data,
a Terra ll leisure land...

00:07:05.258 --> 00:07:09.786
...called "The Japoness Health Center,"
was constructed here 15 years ago.

00:07:09.862 --> 00:07:11.728
Hold on. I seem
to remember-...

00:07:11.798 --> 00:07:15.063
...these commercials running
constantly on TV AGES ago...

00:07:15.201 --> 00:07:17.898
You'll be happy as
a fish in the sea...

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:20.439
...when you stay at the JHC!

00:07:21.007 --> 00:07:22.873
Catering to 1,500 guests...

00:07:22.942 --> 00:07:26.742
...a gigantic leisure land
utilizing natural hot springs...

00:07:26.813 --> 00:07:29.839
THE JAPONESS HEALTH CENTER
--NOW OPEN!

00:07:32.084 --> 00:07:35.054
I LOVE YOU. (The Japoness
Health Center) Government Approved.

00:07:35.121 --> 00:07:37.749
However, not only was it
too far from every country...

00:07:37.824 --> 00:07:41.920
...it was unfavorably situated in the
middle of unstable underground caverns.

00:07:41.994 --> 00:07:45.225
80, guests who had reserved
rooms couldn't make it...

00:07:45.298 --> 00:07:47.858
...leading to an instant
slump in business.

00:07:47.934 --> 00:07:50.926
In the end, it appears it
was closed down 12 years ago.

00:07:52.238 --> 00:07:54.502
It's like a giant tale of stupidity.

00:07:54.574 --> 00:07:59.512
But, the main computer that managed
this center appears to be working.

00:08:04.584 --> 00:08:05.813
Okay, then!

00:08:05.885 --> 00:08:08.820
Since we're here,
let's take a break!

00:08:08.888 --> 00:08:11.289
Can we really, Master Otaru?!

00:08:11.891 --> 00:08:14.690
But, aren't hot springs places where
kids in love tell their parents...

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:16.819
"I'm staying at a friend's tonight..."

00:08:16.896 --> 00:08:19.024
...so they can skip off
for a little hanky-panky?

00:08:19.465 --> 00:08:21.433
Where'd you hear that from?

00:08:21.501 --> 00:08:24.163
Well, we've completed
our mission...

00:08:24.237 --> 00:08:26.899
...so it wouldn't kill us
to have a little break!

00:08:28.508 --> 00:08:31.307
I've always dreamed of going to
a hot spring with Master Otaru!

00:08:31.744 --> 00:08:35.874
Yay!! Hot springs, hot springs!
Otaru and hot springs!

00:08:36.249 --> 00:08:38.980
Which means, it is time for the
highly acclaimed Hot Spring Master...

00:08:39.051 --> 00:08:41.110
...Mitsurugi Hanagata,
to take the fore!

00:08:41.954 --> 00:08:44.651
Since all of you are new to the
ways of the hot spring enjoyment...

00:08:44.724 --> 00:08:46.783
...will educate
you personally.

00:08:46.859 --> 00:08:49.260
For starters,
hot springs require...

00:08:49.328 --> 00:08:51.524
...BATHROBES!"

00:08:52.798 --> 00:08:55.199
And not only that,
but PING-PONG!!

00:08:55.268 --> 00:08:56.895
Take that!

00:08:57.870 --> 00:08:59.099
And that!

00:09:00.606 --> 00:09:02.438
Eat my deadly vacuum
twister spiking--

00:09:05.278 --> 00:09:07.337
PILLOWFIGHTS!"

00:09:10.883 --> 00:09:12.408
Here ya go.

00:09:20.593 --> 00:09:23.790
LATE NIGHT GHOST STORIES!

00:09:24.030 --> 00:09:26.590
NOoo! I'm frightened!

00:09:32.038 --> 00:09:34.097
Hey, Otaru. Having fun?

00:09:34.173 --> 00:09:36.141
Sure. Lots.

00:09:36.609 --> 00:09:39.476
Well, then! I think
I'll go take a dip!

00:09:50.523 --> 00:09:52.082
It prickles all over!

00:09:52.558 --> 00:09:55.858
Yup! We Japoness men
like our baths HOT!

00:09:58.097 --> 00:10:00.395
Aah, what bliss!

00:10:00.466 --> 00:10:05.302
Come to think of it, I've never taken a
real vacation with Lime and the others.

00:10:05.871 --> 00:10:07.965
But I'm not a man...

00:10:09.842 --> 00:10:11.207
That's right...

00:10:11.277 --> 00:10:15.305
I'd forgotten that they were
made to look like women.

00:10:16.148 --> 00:10:18.139
What could human females
have been like...?

00:10:27.126 --> 00:10:29.458
Don't tell me that's Lime?!
Cherry?! Or even, Bloodberry?!

00:10:30.429 --> 00:10:32.397
Wh-What'll I do?!

00:10:33.165 --> 00:10:37.033
Argh! What am I getting
all worked up about?!

00:10:39.105 --> 00:10:40.368
Calm down!

00:10:40.439 --> 00:10:44.307
Calm yourself! Normal!
Just act normal!

00:10:46.545 --> 00:10:47.774
Okay, GO!

00:10:48.347 --> 00:10:50.714
Oh, hi! Did you guys
decide to come, too?

00:10:50.783 --> 00:10:52.410
What are you
waiting for? Hop in!

00:10:52.485 --> 00:10:54.044
Eee!

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:57.715
Otaru, you're so daring!

00:11:03.229 --> 00:11:05.698
You jerk! You made me
think they were here!

00:11:06.298 --> 00:11:08.767
Made you think
who was here, Otaru?

00:11:08.834 --> 00:11:10.199
Oh, you know...!

00:11:13.372 --> 00:11:14.897
How long have you been there?

00:11:15.841 --> 00:11:17.138
| can't say...

00:11:17.209 --> 00:11:19.940
Since you said
"It prickles all over," I think...

00:11:20.479 --> 00:11:22.811
Didn't you notice us, Master Otaru?

00:11:27.420 --> 00:11:30.014
Uh... Hey, guys?
What's with the sparks?

00:11:33.859 --> 00:11:35.486
It could be the water...

00:11:51.010 --> 00:11:53.308
Shall I scrub your back
for you, Master Otaru?

00:11:53.379 --> 00:11:54.608
N-No, thanks...
I'll do it myself.

00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:57.274
Don't be shy! I'll give it a
cleaning it'll never forget!

00:11:57.349 --> 00:11:59.511
- I'll scrub, I'll scrub"
- No, thanks! Really!™!

00:11:59.585 --> 00:12:03.522
THAT'S FAR ENOUGH!! The only one
who will scrub Otaru's back is MEM

00:12:04.190 --> 00:12:05.817
Hanagata! What the hell
are you doing?!

00:12:05.891 --> 00:12:07.950
Here! My chest will be your sponge!

00:12:08.594 --> 00:12:10.289
Knock that off, you freak!

00:12:10.362 --> 00:12:13.923
Begging your pardon, Hana-ness!
BUT YOU STAY OUT OF THIS"

00:12:15.935 --> 00:12:16.902
Huh?

00:12:16.969 --> 00:12:18.733
What? I feel so...

00:12:18.804 --> 00:12:20.363
...50 weak.

00:12:22.641 --> 00:12:24.131
Bloodberry?

00:12:29.582 --> 00:12:30.845
Cherry!

00:12:30.916 --> 00:12:32.645
Otaru...

00:12:34.153 --> 00:12:35.643
Lime!!

00:12:36.422 --> 00:12:38.481
Hey, Lime! Cherry!

00:12:38.791 --> 00:12:41.488
Bloodberry!!
What's happened to you?!

00:13:10.656 --> 00:13:12.124
Lime...

00:13:13.425 --> 00:13:15.689
I'm sorry to always
be such a burden, Otaru...

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:19.598
It's no trouble at all...

00:13:19.665 --> 00:13:21.463
We promised not to speak
about that, remember?

00:13:25.738 --> 00:13:27.069
Bloodberry...

00:13:27.139 --> 00:13:29.437
You, and you were
always the strongest...

00:13:29.508 --> 00:13:31.476
Delicate little yellow crystals...

00:13:32.378 --> 00:13:35.279
...mainly used for the
relief of daily tension...

00:13:35.347 --> 00:13:37.441
...nourishment for the skin...

00:13:38.517 --> 00:13:39.985
Cherry...

00:13:40.853 --> 00:13:42.048
Damn!

00:13:42.121 --> 00:13:45.751
This hot spring was supposed
to revive us, not do THIS!

00:13:49.662 --> 00:13:50.561
Otaru!

00:13:50.629 --> 00:13:52.097
C-C-C-C-C-C-C..

00:13:52.164 --> 00:13:53.632
COME, QUICK"

00:14:11.917 --> 00:14:12.679
What's this?!

00:14:12.751 --> 00:14:15.721
It's a mass of plasma energy
that's accumulated underground!

00:14:16.155 --> 00:14:19.250
This place is getting so full of
plasma, it's starting to go nuts!

00:14:27.833 --> 00:14:30.165
This explains where
plasma clouds come from.

00:14:30.536 --> 00:14:35.406
This thing was the real reason
the health center went belly-up!

00:14:36.175 --> 00:14:41.773
| see now. Lime and the others were
affected because they're marionettes!

00:14:41.847 --> 00:14:44.509
Their mechanical bodies conduct
electricity more easily than ours.

00:14:45.251 --> 00:14:47.686
It's so good to be human!

00:15:02.635 --> 00:15:04.797
O-OTARU! LOOK AT THAT!

00:15:04.870 --> 00:15:06.929
I can't just sit here!

00:15:08.007 --> 00:15:10.135
Otaru...! W-Wait up!!

00:15:29.228 --> 00:15:30.923
This is terrible!

00:15:34.833 --> 00:15:36.801
Snap out of it, Lime!

00:15:41.907 --> 00:15:43.875
C'mon... You too, Bloodberry!

00:15:49.248 --> 00:15:52.115
I'm sorry...
| didn't stop to think...

00:15:53.118 --> 00:15:55.280
Otaru! What are you
still doing here?!

00:15:55.854 --> 00:15:58.551
We have to get away
before it gets us as well!

00:15:58.624 --> 00:16:01.685
Screw of f!| can't
just leave them!

00:16:01.760 --> 00:16:03.353
Hanagata, you help!

00:16:03.429 --> 00:16:05.295
Th..That isn't funny!

00:16:05.364 --> 00:16:09.426
If we went out carrying marionettes,
we'd become plasma food!

00:16:09.501 --> 00:16:10.662
Leave me out of it!

00:16:10.736 --> 00:16:13.171
Say what...?! Hanagata,
you heartless bastard!

00:16:16.809 --> 00:16:18.368
Run, Otaru.

00:16:18.444 --> 00:16:20.572
Now you cut that out, Bloodberry!

00:16:21.213 --> 00:16:24.649
I don't want you
to get hurt, Otaru.

00:16:24.917 --> 00:16:26.248
Lime...

00:16:26.318 --> 00:16:29.845
Don't you stay on our
account, Master Otaru.

00:16:30.522 --> 00:16:31.990
Cherry...

00:16:32.891 --> 00:16:35.986
You're all putting my
safety before your own.

00:16:44.036 --> 00:16:45.595
Otaru, come on!!

00:16:46.538 --> 00:16:48.700
Hanagata, I want iron pipes.

00:16:50.676 --> 00:16:53.043
Get me all of the iron
pipes you can find!

00:16:53.445 --> 00:16:55.106
What do you w-w-want those for?

00:16:55.180 --> 00:16:56.841
JUST GET THEM!!

00:16:58.317 --> 00:17:01.116
Ooh... Just don't
hold me responsible!

00:17:04.923 --> 00:17:08.325
| can't leave you guys behind.

00:17:09.128 --> 00:17:12.792
Oh, but there's nothing to
worry about. Just leave it to me.

00:17:41.226 --> 00:17:42.694
Otaru...

00:17:43.562 --> 00:17:46.190
What the heck are you
going to do with these?

00:17:46.799 --> 00:17:48.631
I'm going to use these
as a lightning rod...

00:17:48.700 --> 00:17:51.067
...to lead the vortex away,
and change its course!

00:17:56.041 --> 00:17:57.372
That's insane!

00:17:57.443 --> 00:18:00.504
If you don't like it...
..I'll do it without you!

00:18:00.879 --> 00:18:02.438
N-No fair!

00:18:22.101 --> 00:18:23.728
HANAGATA!

00:18:46.458 --> 00:18:47.926
Do your worst!

00:18:48.494 --> 00:18:54.957
Your courage feels like
it's about to split in two.

00:18:56.568 --> 00:18:59.731
Get a firm grip
upon it once again...

00:18:59.805 --> 00:19:03.207
...and let's head on out.

00:19:04.543 --> 00:19:07.774
Faintly, I begin to hear...

00:19:08.680 --> 00:19:11.809
...something that sounds like
the roar of distant thunder.

00:19:12.684 --> 00:19:15.585
Even if it costs me my life...

00:19:16.355 --> 00:19:19.848
...I will go to save you.

00:19:20.726 --> 00:19:23.491
Many times, I asked myself...

00:19:24.363 --> 00:19:26.889
...what is love?

00:19:28.767 --> 00:19:31.702
But I am unable
to find the answer.

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:33.966
Is it an illusion?

00:19:34.039 --> 00:19:35.507
Otarul

00:19:36.008 --> 00:19:37.476
Otaru!

00:19:48.187 --> 00:19:49.621
Ready, and...

00:19:49.821 --> 00:19:51.289
Go!

00:19:52.691 --> 00:19:55.717
When I think of you in pain...

00:19:56.728 --> 00:19:59.857
...the distant thunder
falls upon my soul.

00:20:00.632 --> 00:20:03.761
I don't care if
I lose everything...

00:20:04.436 --> 00:20:07.929
...as long as I have you.

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:11.801
Many times, I asked myself...

00:20:12.411 --> 00:20:15.005
...what is love?

00:20:18.850 --> 00:20:22.081
It's absorbing the energy
from the health center!

00:20:22.788 --> 00:20:25.018
- Let's get away while we can!
- Yes!

00:20:50.349 --> 00:20:53.148
A lot of stuff happened,
but wasn't it fun, Otaru?

00:20:53.785 --> 00:20:57.653
Well... In the end, it was
you guys that had to rescue me.

00:20:58.790 --> 00:21:02.749
You were in such bad shape,
too. You guys amaze me.

00:21:03.395 --> 00:21:07.696
Oh, please! I merely wished to
save you, with all my heart and soul...

00:21:07.866 --> 00:21:11.928
You know what? When I was lying there,
I got this warm feeling all over-...

00:21:12.004 --> 00:21:14.632
...and all of a sudden,
| felt strong again.

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:18.708
Yeah. I wasn't fully awake at the time,
so I can't remember clearly, but...

00:21:19.144 --> 00:21:22.239
...it's like something
very important happened...

00:21:24.750 --> 00:21:27.048
0-Oh, well...
Everybody's safe now, right?

00:21:27.119 --> 00:21:29.087
What's it matter?

00:21:31.523 --> 00:21:33.082
Daylight!

00:21:33.825 --> 00:21:36.351
C'mon, guys! Let's go home!

00:21:37.829 --> 00:21:41.629
| could swear I'm not
getting equal treatment...

00:22:10.529 --> 00:22:14.227
When you're sad, when you're blue...

00:22:14.299 --> 00:22:17.997
...don't go off to be alone.

00:22:18.136 --> 00:22:20.969
Just think of me...

00:22:21.039 --> 00:22:25.670
...and I'll be there with you.

00:22:25.911 --> 00:22:29.677
Strength is a very important thing...

00:22:29.748 --> 00:22:33.378
...but tears are important, too.

00:22:33.552 --> 00:22:37.250
You can't do anything at all...

00:22:37.322 --> 00:22:39.120
...with a dried-up heart.

00:22:39.191 --> 00:22:43.150
You can't feel a thing.

00:22:45.230 --> 00:22:47.562
Tell me, why do people hide...

00:22:47.632 --> 00:22:52.593
...what they really feel inside?

00:22:52.804 --> 00:22:56.434
Take what you can do,
what you want to do...

00:22:56.641 --> 00:23:00.236
...one step at a time.

00:23:00.479 --> 00:23:04.074
I love the way you don't care...

00:23:04.149 --> 00:23:07.949
...how you have been
programmed to live.

00:23:08.120 --> 00:23:11.750
| would follow you anywhere.

00:23:12.090 --> 00:23:18.086
I'll never, ever let you go.

00:23:27.439 --> 00:23:29.237
Good afternoon! My name is Cherry!

00:23:29.307 --> 00:23:31.639
What?! Master Otaru is making
his big show business debut?!

00:23:31.710 --> 00:23:33.439
He's appearing in
movies, commercials...

00:23:33.512 --> 00:23:35.503
...and even the year's end
Celebrity Song Tournament...

00:23:35.580 --> 00:23:38.015
Why, Master Otaruis
the talk of the town!

00:23:38.083 --> 00:23:41.815
But, it's like he has gone somewhere
far away, and it is so lonely...

00:23:41.887 --> 00:23:44.549
Tell me, Lime...
What do you think we should do?

00:23:44.623 --> 00:23:46.200
Next on Saber Marionette J!

00:23:46.224 --> 00:23:49.470
Otaru's Big Debut! Time For You
To Shine Next on Saber Marionette J!

00:23:49.494 --> 00:23:51.588
Otaru's Big Debut! Time For You
To Shine Master Otaruy, I love you!
